The entries is a list of 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 4, 4, 8, and 8.
The low is 0.
The high is the last position of entries.
Repeat while low is less than high.
The middle is (low plus high) divided by 2.
If middle modulo 2 is 1, subtract 1 from middle.
The here is item middle of entries.
The next is item (middle plus 1) of entries.
If here is next, set low to middle plus 2, otherwise set high to middle.

The answer is item low of entries.
Show answer.
